<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-export SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/evernote-export4.dtd">
<en-export export-date="20260712T042726Z" application="Evernote" version="11.24.3">
  <note>
    <title>jptextparser</title>
    <created>20241206T052502Z</created>
    <updated>20241207T092726Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>大塚一輝</author>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd"><en-note><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><h2 style="--en-nodeId:77670590-b68a-4ceb-8b3d-cbe9f22ec5fc;"> <span style="color:#52708b;">Getting Started (Ubuntu)</span></h2><div><br/></div><div>Prerequisites:</div><div>- Python, version >= 3.9.5</div><div>- libcommon `git clone <a href="https://github.com/ThinkXInc/libcommon.git" rev="en_rl_none">https://github.com/ThinkXInc/libcommon.git</a>`</div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>Clone jptextparser (and nlpmodel submodule)</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>git submodule add git@github.com:ThinkXInc/jptextparser.git</div><div>cd jptextparser</div><div>git submodule sync</div><div>git submodule update --init --recursive</div><div>git lfs pull</div></div><div><br/></div><div>Install python dependencies</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>pip install mecab-python3 pykakasi bson bs4 pymongo mojimoji</div></div><div>```</div><div><br/></div><div>Install mecab ipadic necessities</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>sudo apt install mecab libmecab-dev mecab-ipadic-utf8</div></div><div>```</div><div><br/></div><div>Install mecab ipadic-neologd</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/neologd/mecab-ipadic-neologd.git</div><div>cd mecab-ipadic-neologd</div><div>./bin/install-mecab-ipadic-neologd -n</div></div><div>```</div><div><br/></div><div>...</div><div><br/></div><div>> [<span style="color:#64aeb3;">install-mecab-ipadic-NEologd</span>] : Do you want to install mecab-ipadic-NEologd? Type yes or no.  </div><div>> yes  </div><div>>   </div><div>> [<span style="color:#64aeb3;">install-mecab-ipadic-NEologd</span>] : Install completed.  </div><div>> [<span style="color:#64aeb3;">install-mecab-ipadic-NEologd</span>] : When you use MeCab, you can set '/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/mecab/dic/mecab-ipadic-neologd' as a value of '-d' option of MeCab.  </div><div>> [<span style="color:#64aeb3;">install-mecab-ipadic-NEologd</span>] : Usage of mecab-ipadic-NEologd is here.  </div><div>> Usage:  </div><div>>     $ mecab -d <b><span style="color:#508aaa;">**</span><span style="color:#6ab0a3;">/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/mecab/dic/mecab-ipadic-neologd</span><span style="color:#508aaa;">**</span></b> ...  </div><div>> </div><div><br/></div><div><span style="color:#508aaa;">###</span> <span style="color:#52708b;">&lt;- write this mecab dic system path to </span><a href="https://config.py" rev="en_rl_none">config.py</a></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>Error shooting</div><div>----</div><div>https://github.com/SamuraiT/mecab-python3/issues</div><div><br/></div><div>issueを英語で書く必要はありません。</div><div><br/></div><div>------------------- ERROR DETAILS ------------------------</div><div>arguments: -r /src/quantz/processing-server/jptextparser/mecabrc/mecabrc</div><div>default dictionary path: /src/quantz/processing-server/venv_respond/lib/python3.9/site-packages/unidic/dicdir</div><div>) [tokenizer_->open(param)] tokenizer.cpp(130) [sysdic->isCompatible(*d)] incompatible dictionary: /src/quantz/processing-server/jptextparser/etc/userdic/out/manbyo.dic</div><div>----------------------------------------------------------</div><div>-> manbyo.dicがipadicと異なるエンコード，特にバイナリの可能性があるので変換必要</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div> file /src/quantz/processing-server/jptextparser/etc/userdic/out/manbyo.dic</div></div><div><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">/src/quantz/processing-server/jptextparser/etc/userdic/out/manbyo.dic: data</span></div><div><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">-> dataつまりバイナリ</span></div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>mecab -d /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/mecab/dic/mecab-ipadic-neologd \</div><div>-u /src/quantz/processing-server/jptextparser/etc/userdic/out/manbyo.dic</div></div><div><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">If this works without errors, the dictionary is correctly rebuilt.</span></div><div><br/></div><div>---</div><div><br/></div><div><span style="color:#508aaa;">###</span> <span style="color:#52708b;">Test run</span></div><div><br/></div><div>kana convert</div><div>```</div><div>python run_<a href="https://example.py" rev="en_rl_none">example.py</a></div><div>```</div><div><br/></div><div>preprocessor</div><div>```</div><div># TODO:</div><div>```</div><div><br/></div><div><span style="color:#508aaa;">###</span> <span style="color:#52708b;">API</span></div><div><br/></div><div><span style="color:#508aaa;">####</span> <span style="color:#52708b;">Kana convert</span></div><div><br/></div><div>```python</div><div><span style="color:#508aaa;">from</span> jptextparser.kana <span style="color:#508aaa;">import</span> Kana, WordCategory</div><div><br/></div><div>kana_init_config <span style="color:#508aaa;">=</span> {</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_manbyo_dic_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_hyakuyaku_dic_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_eijiro_dic_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_enamdic_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_ime_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_wikipedia_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_daijirin_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_kasen_dic_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_symbol_dic_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_others_dic_used'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span></div><div>}</div><div>kana <span style="color:#508aaa;">=</span> Kana(<span style="color:#508aaa;">**</span>kana_init_config)</div><div><br/></div><div>kana_process_config <span style="color:#508aaa;">=</span> {</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_symbol_removed'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_return_removed'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_symbol_readable'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_html_tag_removed'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_url_removed'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_text_in_parentheses_removed'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_suuji_readable'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">False</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_punctuation_removed'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span>,</div><div>    <span style="color:#64aeb3;">'is_eos_removed'</span>: <span style="color:#52708b;">True</span></div><div>}</div><div><br/></div><div>result <span style="color:#508aaa;">=</span> kana.kana(text, <span style="color:#508aaa;">**</span>kana_process_config)</div><div>```</div><div><br/></div><div>(Results)</div><div>```</div><div>30ドルを1891円(または11619円)と交換して胡蝶のインカ帝国にApple,IncをGetするのですか？</div><div>サンジュウドル ヲ センハッピャクキュウジュウイチエン ト コーカン シ テ コチョー ノ インカテイコク ニ アップル ヲ ゲ スル ノ デス カ</div><div>(['30ドル', 'を', '1891円', 'と', '交換', 'し', 'て', '胡蝶', 'の', 'インカ帝国', 'に', 'Apple Inc', 'を', 'Get', 'する', 'の', 'です', 'か'], [1, 5, 1, 5, 1, 2, 5, 1, 5, 1, 5, 1, 5, 1, 2, 1, 5, 5], ['サンジュウドル', 'ヲ', 'センハッピャクキュウジュウイチエン', 'ト', 'コーカン', 'シ', 'テ', 'コチョー', 'ノ', 'インカテイコク', 'ニ', 'アップル', 'ヲ', 'ゲットゥ\r', 'スル', 'ノ', 'デス', 'カ'])</div><div>['名詞', '助詞', '名詞', '助詞', '名詞', '動詞', '助詞', '名詞', '助詞', '名詞', '助詞', '名詞', '助詞', '名詞', '動詞', '名詞', '助詞', '助詞']</div><div>elapse: 0.00285sec</div><div>```</div><div><br/></div><div><span style="color:#508aaa;">####</span> <span style="color:#52708b;">Process japanese text</span></div><div><span style="color:#508aaa;">####</span> <span style="color:#52708b;">TODO:</span></div><div>```</div><div>from jptextparser.preprocess import Preprocessor</div><div>jp_processor = Preprocessor()</div><div>result = jp_processor.parse(text)</div><div>```</div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
